B.ara=s(["All six cashflow chart modes now use new cat sprite artwork selected by income and expense ratios.","Pie, donut, savings bank, bar, balance, and food-can modes each use their own ratio animation.","Recalibrated transparent bounds and subject anchors to reduce frame drift and neighboring-image bleed.","Updated the donut and hidden-mode icons in the cashflow chart selector."],t.s)
